10
00:39:35,000 --> 00:39:41,000
Ready or Not is a 2019 American comedy horror film directed by Matt
Bettinelli-Olpin and Tyler Gillett, and written by Guy Busick and R.

11
00:43:32,500 --> 00:43:38,500
Christopher Murphy.

12
00:47:30,000 --> 00:47:36,000
It stars Samara Weaving, Adam Brody, Mark O'Brien, Elyse Levesque,
Nicky Guadagni, Henry Czerny and Andie MacDowell.

13
00:51:27,500 --> 00:51:33,500
It follows a young bride who is hunted by her spouse's wealthy family
as part of a wedding night ritual to worship the Devil.

14
00:55:25,000 --> 00:55:31,000
Preparations began in November 2017 when Bettinelli-Olpin and Gillett, members of the filmmaking collective
Radio Silence, were hired as directors, with Busick and Murphy attached to write the screenplay.

15
00:59:22,500 --> 00:59:28,500
After setting an initial release date, casting
occurred from August to October 2018.

16
01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:26,000
Principal photography began later that month and concluded in November, in
locations in and around Toronto, Canada and the surrounding Ontario area.

17
01:07:17,500 --> 01:07:23,500
Brian Tyler was hired to compose and conduct the film's score, marking
his first collaboration with Bettinelli-Olpin and Gillett.

18
01:11:15,000 --> 01:11:21,000
Ready or Not premiered at the Fantasia International Film Festival on July 27, 2019, and was
theatrically released in the United States on August 21, 2019, by Searchlight Pictures.

19
01:15:12,500 --> 01:15:18,500
It received positive reviews from critics and grossed $57.6
million worldwide against a $6 million budget.

20
01:19:10,000 --> 01:19:16,000
It was nominated for Best Horror Film at the 46th Saturn Awards.

21
01:23:07,500 --> 01:23:13,500
A sequel, Ready or Not 2: Here I Come, is
scheduled to be released in March 2026.

22
01:27:05,000 --> 01:27:11,000
The film explores themes of escape, ritual, marriage, satanism, gore.

23
01:31:02,500 --> 01:31:08,500
The tone is lighthearted and dark.
